From 88a787fed448438be1f8b790f5a8a8158d8c04d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuepixel <yuepixel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 10:13:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(qwen3.6 moe cuda): read compressed-tensors NVFP4 routed
 experts + MTP

- qwen3_5/nvfp4_load: optional mlp= callback so the MoE family builds its own
  mlp fields; intermediate falls back to shared_expert/moe_intermediate_size
- cuda/moe: dispatch nvx.Experts4 in moe()
- qwen3_5_moe: QUANT_METHODS + check() admit modelopt/compressed-tensors
- qwen3_5_moe/cuda/weights: routed4() folds E routed experts + the shared expert
  into one Experts4 table (E+1 rows), reciprocal global scale for compressed-tensors;
  MTP nvfp4 path from model-mtp.safetensors (bf16 fc/attn as dense QLinear,
  experts quantized from the fused bf16 gate_up/down); MTP_FILES naming
- qwen3_5_moe/cuda: engine admission + MTP weights; mtp.py uses _mm and glue.embedding
- test: tests/test_qwen36_moe_check.py
